What you may do
  - Install and use Swep on computers you own or control, free of charge, for
    everything the Free edition offers.
  - Use the Pro features on as many computers at once as your activation code
    or subscription allows (two, unless the creator sets another number for
    your licence), and move a licence between your computers with Swep Pro ->
    Deactivate.
  - Keep copies of the installer for your own backups.

What you may not do
  - Copy, publish, sell, rent, lend or redistribute Swep or any part of it,
    other than by linking to the official downloads.
  - Modify, translate, decompile, disassemble or reverse-engineer Swep, or
    make anything derived from it, except where the law allows this
